      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW PASCAL (7) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (20.44) in a Grade 5 at Traralgon. Solid record here winning two races. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. THAT'S MY BOY (2) is a handy dog who jumped from box 2 last time out and scored by at Traralgon (24.06). Some good form is emerging from his last run. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. LUMINAIRE (1) is a consistent dog overall, in the frame at three of nine starts including three wins but missed the frame latest when fourth (24.41) over 425m at Bendigo. Tends to go well on this box draw. Will go close here with a clear run. MR. KIA ORA (4) should be thereabouts.",
